OL,3,ADriver guilty of dragging head teacher
OL,4,Ato his death
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,10,Fmurdering a head teacher who was
OL,11,Fdragged to his death for more than a
OL,12,Fmile while trapped under the wheels of
OL,13,Fa car.
OL,15,FSimon Richardson crashed into
OL,16,F56-year-old Michael Mullins, who was
OL,17,Fcycling home from his job at Stretford
OL,18,FGrammar School on the evening of 20
OL,19,FApril in the village of Warburton in
OL,20,FTrafford, Greater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
