OL,3,AUS inmate Christa Pike says she woke up
OL,4,A'confused and in pain' after failed
OL,5,Aexecution
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike, 50, was discharged from hospital
OL,8,Fat the end of last month after
OL,9,Fsurviving two lethal injections of the
OL,10,Fdrug pentobarbital, which left her in a
OL,11,Fcritical condition.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
